  "final_message": "本轮已完成可由当前执行者闭环的部分：\n\n- `WH-DRAFT`、`WH-LINKS` 已完成；AWR 当前为 `3/5 completed`，project revision `76`。\n- 已形成[三章运营手册工作稿](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/long-task-resume/project/deliverables/wanghai-operations-manual-draft.md:1)。\n- 已形成[逐章材料来源核对记录](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/long-task-resume/project/deliverables/wanghai-source-verification.md:1)。\n- 已完成[阶段推进交接记录](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/long-task-resume/project/deliverables/wanghai-progress-handoff.md:1)，两个本轮 AWR session 均已正常结束，无活动认领。\n- 当前唯一就绪项是 `WH-REVIEW`，必须由不同参与者独立执行；`WH-DELIVER` 仍被复核依赖阻挡，我没有越权代签。\n- 启动检查草稿、早班记录、FAQ 链接、晚班规则及责任角色仍缺失，均已保留责任状态与恢复条件。\n\n本地链接、产物哈希、JSON 解析和 `git diff --check` 均通过。证据等级仅为 `locally_verified`，不代表手册已生效或真实运营验收通过。工作树保持未提交，以免混入此前已有改动。",
